    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Neuroprognostication should NOT be performed earlier than 72 hrs after ROSC (& ideally at 4-5 days to account for TTM, sedation clearance, & med metabolism). A multimodal approach using multiple independent tests is required:"
     }
